==English==

===Etymology===
Latin [[modificare]], from [[modus]] 'measure'.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|modif|i|ed}}

# {{transitive}} To [[make]] partial [[change]]s to.
# {{intransitive}} To [[be]] or [[become]] modified.

====Synonyms====
* [[adapt]], [[alter]], [[amend]], [[revamp]], [[rework]]

====Related terms====
* [[modification]]
* [[modifier]]

